      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A retrospective review of laparotomies was undertaken to define the indications for abdominal procedures in patients with multiple system organ failure. This study suggests patients with (MSOF) must be thoroughly evaluated with non-invasive technology to determine the presence of an intra-abdominal septic focus prior to consideration of exploratory laparotomy."},
